  "page": {
    "description": "Ubuntu editions and architectures: the 26.04 LTS and the 26.10 interim, compared side by side, with official images and a ROMinit USB walkthrough.",
    "eyebrow": "OPERATING SYSTEM / UBUNTU LTS",
    "intro": "Canonical's releases on one page: the 26.04.1 LTS with five years of security updates, and the 26.10 interim with GNOME 51 and Linux 7.3 on a nine-month clock. Pick a release, then Desktop or Server and the architecture.",
